# Dynamic buffering capped at max_buffering_ticks=2: "Max audio buffering reached" warning, then the lagging source is handled by ignore_audio (drop lagging samples / restart).
init 48000 2 2 0
clock 1000000000
timeline 1000000000
source a input
video_mix 1
channel 0 0 a
set a active 1
output a 48000 2 4096 900000000 const 0.25
state a
run 6 1
state a
